OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fmoving in from the west on the breeze
OL,7,Fshould largely die out in the evening,
OL,8,Fleaving clear spells. Becoming chilly
OL,9,Flater in the night under lasting
OL,10,Fclearer skies as the wind eases.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FFine during the morning, with
OL,13,Fsome warm sunshine after a cool start
OL,14,Fin places. Becoming breezier later,
OL,15,Fwith thickening cloud eventually
OL,16,Fbringing a little light rain in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
