OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fand rather cloudy at times over the
OL,7,Fweekend with a little rain, although
OL,8,FSunday perhaps brighter overall.
OL,9,FLikely turning more settled and warmer
OL,10,Ffor a time from Monday.
